#: 4d1b16109b1e4b899abd5929625964b9
msgid ""
"with :program:`Qubes OS Global Config`, the **recommended way** for the most "
"common policies"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-edit-a-policy.rst:9
#: 4b5fa8ca1ffa49cb83b433c42e586dd7
msgid ""
"with :program:`Qubes Policy Editor`, a graphical text editor dedicated to "
"this task"
